CommitDate: Tue Feb 25 15:54:12 2025 +0000

    Bug 393523 - Fix "Undelete" and "Shift-Delete" in different menus and buttons. r=aleca,gds,mkmelin


    - Display "Undelete" only if all selected messages are marked as deleted, otherwise a delete action may be performed by the view.

    - Permanently delete messages only when the Shift key is pressed and the messages are not already marked as deleted.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D219408

